  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enterprise and Assets Growth Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved Micro Small and Medium Enterprise access to appropriate financial services translating into higher economic benefits for state, and poor and marginalised groups, in Pakistan. EAGR programme will also contribute to the UK government commitment to respond to the challenges and opportunities of climate change by making green investments in SMEs within Pakistan which is an ODA eligible country.</narrative>
  </description>
